sing river after I checked) suggests strength, likely a flush given the 3-club board. With only one pair of Kings and the 9♣ not contributing to a flush, I'm likely behind. Preserving my chip lead by folding is the prudent play here. The 300 call might seem small, but I'm probably beat, and maintaining my advantage is more important than chasing this pot.\n\nAnswer: -1"}
